# Core guardrails

## Stack
- Static portfolio: React 18 + Vite 6. App lives in `src/main.jsx` and `src/styles.css`.
- Host: Cloudflare Pages. Build `npm run build`, output `dist`. Vite `base` is `/`.
- Contact: Formspree via `import.meta.env.VITE_FORMSPREE_ID`. Do not invent a backend.
- Canonical deploy notes: `README.md`.

## Local agent
- Do not start `npm run dev` or `npm run preview` unless explicitly asked. Stop leftover preview/dev processes when asked.
- PowerShell: do not use `&&`; use `;` or separate commands.
- Make minimal, task-focused diffs. No drive-by refactors or TypeScript migrations unless asked.
- Do not commit, push, force-push, or amend unless explicitly asked. Never force-push `main` unless the user requests it (warn if they do).

## Content
- Do not invent jobs, metrics, or projects. Keep copy aligned with existing timeline, skills, and resume HTML in `public/`.

## Details (do not weaken)
- UI/a11y → `10-ui-react`. Deploy/env → `20-deploy`. Workflow → `60-efficient-agent-workflow`.
